---
title: TikFinity setup
pageSlug: tikfinity-setup
mod: tikfinitok
section: config
order: 2
---

In TikFinity go to **Setup → Minecraft Connection**:

- **Host:** `127.0.0.1`
- **Port:** `4567`

Set your Minecraft username in TikFinity to match your in-game name **exactly**.

Create actions with **Exec Minecraft Command**, for example:

```
execute at YourName run summon zombie ~ ~5 ~
```

After first launch, edit `config/tikfinitok-common.toml` to change the web server port. Any ServerTap-compatible client can use the same HTTP API.
